== Overview ==
The '''Balaclava Spider Toilet''' is an [[Enemies|enemy]] added in the [[Episode 70 Part 2 Update]]. It appears on [[Nightmare Mode|Nightmare]] and [[Endless Mode]]. This toilet '''''can''''' stun, but has an extremely low chance to do so to your units.

== Appearance ==
The '''Balaclava Spider Toilet''' has a grey toilet bowl with the same color as its two claws and its four, thin, spider legs, it has a black balaclava covering every bit of its face except its eyes, and it has a grey acid cannon that stuns units and a yellow toxic barrel with 2 bombs connected to it. Despite having a mask, we know that it has dark skin, due to the leak video. 

== Abilities ==

* Claw Attack: Uses its claw hands to stun nearby [[units]].
* Acid Gun Attack: It shoots some green acid that stuns nearby units.

== Strategy ==

* This enemy has quite a lot of health, so you are recommended to bring high-DPS units for the mode this enemy appears in. This will also help you with other enemies.
* Healing units are not that needed as this enemy rarely stuns.

== Trivia ==

* He is based off of the '''[https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Balaclava_Grenadier_Skibidi_Toilet Masked Acid Bomber Skibidi Toilet]''' from the original series.
* He has the same face the [[Massive Buzzsaw Oven]] under his mask.

